teximage.text:
$$
\textbf{Putnam 1993, A-2}
\\
\\
\begin{aligned}
&\text{Let } (x_{n})_{n\ge0} \text{ be a sequence of nonzero real numbers such that} \\
&x_{n}^{2}-x_{n-1}x_{n+1}=1 \text{ for } n=1,2,3,\dots. \\
&\text{Prove that there exists a real number } a \text{ such that } x_{n+1}=ax_{n}-x_{n-1}.
\end{aligned}
$$
